ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi122: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 3 edges; e1: very short LINE (0,0,0)→(0.0001,0,0) length=0.0001mm IS leading tail; e2: normal LINE (0.0001,0,0)→(1.0001,0,0) length=1.0mm; e3: closing LINE (1.0001,0,0)→(0,0,0) length≈1.0001mm; FixTails detects trailing short edges but not leading edges IS defect; asymmetric threshold logic — leading tail e1 IS undetected; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
